  "limitations": [
    "Dilutive potential shares (ESOP, convertibles) are not present in dataset schema v1, so the diluted count is the EPS-implied count and carries the DILUTION_PROXY cap.",
    "Net debt subtracts cash and cash equivalents plus liquid investments only; restricted balances, margin money and regulatory balances are excluded from available cash by construction (R-4.1 / Schedule III). Dataset schema v1 carries no restricted-balance line item, so the component is published as NOT_COMPUTABLE rather than as a zero.",
    "The corporate-action table carries no dividend declaration record in dataset schema v1, so R-15 corroboration is unavailable for this assessment.",
    "Net debt could not be derived (NOT_REPORTED), so every enterprise-value method is withheld rather than run on a partial bridge.",
    "Associates/JV carrying value is not recorded in the dataset schema (NOT_COMPUTABLE: NOT_REPORTED), so the enterprise-to-equity bridge substitutes zero for that term under policy associates-treatment/1.0.0. This is a policy substitution, not an issuer-reported nil: equity value is understated by any associates/JV carrying value the issuer reports.",
    "R-4.3's policy-default penalty is applied: the valuation leans on 1 distinct assumption category(ies) (POLICY_DEFAULT_WACC 0.2) triggered by DCF_FCFF/discountRate. The reductions are additive and capped once at 0.35, so the published confidence carries a 0.2 reduction (\u00d70.8); multiple methods sharing one assumption category carry one penalty, and no minimum-confidence floor exists.",
    "Associates/JV review required (REVIEW_DUE): The associates/JV carrying value has been unavailable since the evidence date 2026-03-31, and the 180-day treatment review fell due on 2026-09-27. The owner must obtain current issuer evidence for the carrying value, or explicitly reconsider the POLICY_ZERO treatment; the flag itself changes no value, no nil and no confidence. A review flag is not a carrying value: no figure has been established, no unavailable input has been converted into a nil, and the flag changes no valuation output.",
    "Assessment only: no persistence, no transport and no UI are part of IID-2 (IID-3 and IID-6 own those)."
